      "writtenOn": "2023-03-24T21:55:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The main thing I was thinking is that in the future, some tests may want to customize what they call in the `run_test` function. In that case, they would define their own `run_test`, but could still call `run_all_googletest_tests` if they wanted. (We\u0027d need to wrap `run_test` in an `ifdef` so it doesn\u0027t get defined twice though.)",
